保つ。\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6179:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2950:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1933:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1215:crates/mycad-kernel/src/primitives/cylinder.rs:180:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6180:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2953:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1936:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1244:    /// T01: Determinism — identical inputs produce identical solids (field-by-field).\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6181:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2954:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1937:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1272:    /// T02: Topology counts.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6182:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2955:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1938:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1291:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6183:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2956:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1939:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1310:    /// T04: Manifold condition — each edge referenced by exactly 2 HEs with opposite orientation,\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6184:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2957:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1940:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1363:    /// T07: Determinism — same input → same output.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6185:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2958:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1941:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1380:    /// T08: Regression — cuboid tessellation is byte-i