phere)\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6412:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3345:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3140:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1588:crates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:149:// T08: 422 degenerate dimension (zero-width box)\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6413:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3346:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3141:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1589:crates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:158:// T09: 422 assembly unsupported\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6414:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3347:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3142:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1592:crates/mycad-kernel/src/primitives/cylinder.rs:133:    /// T01: Determinism — identical inputs produce identical solids (field-by-field).\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6415:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3348:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3143:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1593:crates/mycad-kernel/src/primitives/cylinder.rs:161:    /// T02: Topology counts.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6416:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3349:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3144:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1594:crates/mycad-kernel/src/primitives/cylinder.rs:180:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6417:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3350:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3145:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1595:crates/mycad-kernel/src/primitives/cylinder.rs:199:    /// T04: Manifold condition — each edge referenced by exactly 2 HEs with opposite orientation,\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6418:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3351:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3146:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1596:crates/mycad-kernel/src/primitives/cylinder.rs:254:    /// T05: Geometry — seam vertices and surface coefficients.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6419:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3353:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3148:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1600:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:179:- R03(high) **部分採用 / 反論**: 「`HalfEdge` に twin/next/prev を追加」は **却下**。本 kernel は index-based でループの順序配列から隣接を導く設計（ADR-001、既存 `make_cuboid`・`tessellate_solid` も隣接フィールド非依存）であり、隣接ポインタ追加は #12 のスコープを超える全 brep 改修・retessellation を招く。R03 の本質（参照数集計だけでは loop 閉包・seam 接続を検証できない）は妥当なので、**T04 をループ閉包の幾何検証へ強化**して代替担保する（隣接構造の導入は将来 Boolean/フィレットが必要とした時点で別途検討）。\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6420:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3355:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3150:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1602:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:187:| T01 | 決定性(primitive) | `make_cylinder(5,20)` を `IdGenerator::new(0)` で2回生成し全 ID・座標・面が一致 | `assert_eq!` |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6421:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3356:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3151:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1603:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:188:| T02 | トポロジー | 頂点2・エッジ3・面3・シェル1(closed)・HE6・loop3 | 各 `len()` 一致 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6422:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3357:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3152:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1604:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:189:| T03 | Euler | V−E+F == 2 | `assert_eq!(2-3+3, 2)` 相当の検証 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6423:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3358:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3153:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1605:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:190:| T04 | マニフォルド+ループ閉包 | 各エッジがちょうど 2 HE に参照され向きが逆。**かつ**各 loop で連続 HE の終点 ≈ 次 HE の始点、最後の HE 終点 ≈ 先頭 HE 始点（`approx`）。seam 接続も検証 | 集計 + 幾何連続性検証 (R03) |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6424:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3359:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3154:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1606:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:191:| T05 | 幾何 | シーム頂点が (0,r,0)/(0,r,h)、各 Surface/Curve の係数 | `approx` で一致 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6425:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3360:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3155:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1607:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:192:| T06 | テッセレーション正常系 | `tessellate_solid(cyl)` の三角形数 = angular*2(側面) + (angular-2)*2(キャップ) 等、既定 angular=32 で算出した期待値 | `triangle_count` 一致 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6426:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3361:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3156:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1608:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:193:| T07 | 決定性(tessellate) | 同一入力2回で positions/normals/indices 一致 | `assert_eq!` |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6427:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3362:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3157:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1609:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:194:| T08 | 回帰(平面不変) | `make_cuboid` の `tessellate_solid` が従来どおり 12三角形/24頂点/36 index。cuboid は逆向き Line HE を含むため R01 の向き対応も同時に担保 | 既存テスト維持 + positions が従来値と一致 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6428:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3363:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3158:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1610:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:195:| T09 | 外向き法線 | 全 facet の幾何法線が重心からの外向きと同符号（凸形状なので判定可） | 検証 |\\nfeatures/19-ru